Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.49,0:00:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.15,0:00:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh! incorporation!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.69,0:00:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh! Y-Gi-Oh! Y-Gi-Oh! Drew!\NYu-Gi-Oh! You keep the kiss!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.13,0:01:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,that slacker should have been here\N10 minutes ago i've got duels to win
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.29,0:01:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,here comes joey now hey guys long time\Nno see hey still in the tournament
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.53,0:01:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,wheeler you bet i'm already the\Nproud owner of two locator cards then
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.41,0:01:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,i guess i'm twice as good what you got\Nfour locator cards Awesome job, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.91,0:01:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got three so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.35,0:01:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, man, I got the least.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.35,0:01:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,How am I ever going to make\Nit to the Battle City Finals?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.49,0:01:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.57,0:01:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,There's still plenty of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.01,0:01:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You need a total of six locator\Ncards to get to the finals,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.65,0:01:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,and I know you can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.15,0:01:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, none of us are going to get to the\Nfinals if we're standing around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.89,0:01:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Mai's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.99,0:01:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out, because I'm about\Nto do some serious catching up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.13,0:01:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck and miss me, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.63,0:01:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.57,0:01:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Luck is for amateurs. Later, Yuge.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.81,0:01:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I know one of Merrick's\Nhunters is after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.79,0:02:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be ready for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.31,0:02:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm watching every move\Nyou make, little Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.07,0:02:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi already took off?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.93,0:02:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, he wanted to get an early\Nstart on the tournament today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.61,0:02:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you to get off the phone\Nso we could meet him on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.03,0:02:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, I was on an\Nextremely important call.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.01,0:02:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I needed to take care of\Nsome serious business, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.49,0:02:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean flirting with serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.37,0:02:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate, I'm never going\Nto get to see Yugi duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.37,0:02:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.28,0:02:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll slip on my comfy shoes\Nand help you two find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.73,0:02:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to snag me some of those locator\Ncards so mine doesn't totally show me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.77,0:02:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But who's going to be my next challenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.63,0:02:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ready for anyone who wants to duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.15,0:02:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This deck of mine always comes through.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.91,0:02:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey Wheeler? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.63,0:02:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew I recognized you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.43,0:02:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Think I could have your autograph?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.77,0:02:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you're just walking\Naround the street like a regular guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.87,0:02:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.83,0:02:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,So who should I make it out to?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.07,0:03:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.98,0:03:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Make it out to my sister, Jessica.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.57,0:03:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.65,0:03:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,This will totally blow her mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.53,0:03:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,She has a big crush on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.99,0:03:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.97,0:03:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.88,0:03:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,To my adoring fan, Jessica.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.85,0:03:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That dual disc is so\Ntotally cool. Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.03,0:03:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I do make this thing look\Npretty cool, don't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.03,0:03:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.53,0:03:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think it would be\Nokay if I tried it on?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.03,0:03:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Just for a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.15,0:03:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise I'll be careful with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.63,0:03:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.54,0:03:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess it couldn't do any harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.03,0:03:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.95,0:03:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, Sands, this is so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.05,0:03:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Being a toolist is hard work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.91,0:03:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't just put a tool disc\Nonto your arm and then presto.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.17,0:03:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You got exercise.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.69,0:03:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,My tool disc.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.11,0:03:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back here, you little rat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.95,0:03:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi could be anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.79,0:03:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.87,0:03:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a pretty good view from up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.57,0:03:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Check that out, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.03,0:03:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You little lying punk. It's a chase?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.91,0:03:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like some youngsters\Nare playing tag.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.49,0:03:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.13,0:03:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.63,0:03:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I got your back, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.09,0:04:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the rush? Get off of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.67,0:04:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan, what's he doing\Nwith your dual disc?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.13,0:04:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I'm about to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.45,0:04:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.01,0:04:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know how else\Nto become a dualist.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.41,0:04:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,See,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.32,0:04:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally built the deck that I could duel\Nwith When this guy stole all my cards So
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.95,0:04:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,you stole someone else's I know it was\Nwrong I just wanted to be in the Battle City
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.91,0:04:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Tournament That's all The most important\Npart of being a great duelist Is always
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.09,0:04:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,playing with honor There would be no
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.97,0:04:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Satisfaction in cheating\Nyour way in. You're right,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.27,0:04:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry So who's the punk\Nthat stole your dueling deck?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.59,0:04:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know He had bug eyes\Nand a head like a blue beetle
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.19,0:04:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Bug eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.31,0:04:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Head like a beetle?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.61,0:04:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.59,0:04:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gotta be Weevil Underwood.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.85,0:04:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess Weevil's still up\Nto his old tricks, eh, Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.91,0:04:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, now I'm angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.59,0:04:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.83,0:04:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna teach that\Nlittle bug a thing or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.41,0:05:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,He's by the fountain. He's mine. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.77,0:05:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey. Goodbye now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.13,0:05:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,See ya, and good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.79,0:05:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,So, were you successful?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.89,0:05:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, totally.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.23,0:05:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I did what you told me to, and\Nthey believed every single word.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.43,0:05:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Then the fools have\Ncrawled right into my trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.97,0:05:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Weaver is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.45,0:05:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.79,0:05:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Now give me that rare\Ncard you promised me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.79,0:05:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, yes, the rare card.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.27,0:05:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.18,0:05:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's a stinkin' Gokobor card.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.13,0:05:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody has this one. Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.75,0:05:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,So you want me to give\Nyou something else? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.25,0:05:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, how about a\Ntaste of my arachno-slide?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.71,0:05:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,My plan is coming together perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.89,0:05:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi may have defeated my great\NMoth in doing this kingdom,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.27,0:06:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,but after the trap I've set,\NWhaler won't stand a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.07,0:06:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Kenta, you can't hide from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.55,0:06:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity, did you hear\Nanyone come in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.03,0:06:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,No, why do you ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.23,0:06:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a little boy\Nrunning around the ward
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.83,0:06:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,trying to avoid getting his x-rays taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.11,0:06:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.45,0:06:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he won't go near the machine,\Neven though I told him it's painless.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.61,0:06:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay, you can come out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.95,0:06:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You knew I was here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.27,0:06:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I could hear you breathing under the bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.67,0:06:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So, how come you didn't turn me in?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.69,0:06:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I was kind of scared of\Nsome of the tests here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.33,0:06:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But, you know, they're not\Nas bad as you think they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.83,0:06:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,There must be something I can do to\Npay you back for covering for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.11,0:06:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Any ideas? Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.91,0:06:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I've got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.21,0:07:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You could check out the\NBattle City website for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.67,0:07:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, but how come?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.33,0:07:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,My brother's dueling today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.03,0:07:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a duelist? Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.83,0:07:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, where is that bug-eyed punk?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.53,0:07:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That kid said he was around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.83,0:07:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Looking for someone? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.87,0:07:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I smelled a dung beetle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.45,0:07:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my critique after all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.19,0:07:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You stole that little kid's\Ncards, didn't you, Worm Breath?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.75,0:07:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't remember stealing any cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.21,0:07:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, then maybe I can\Nhelp refresh your memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.29,0:07:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.61,0:07:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll settle this fair\Nand square with a duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.21,0:07:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Be really careful, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.23,0:07:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember when Weevil threw Yugi's Exodia\Ncards off the boat to Duelist Island?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.95,0:07:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy's a major cheater.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.13,0:07:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Careful where you point that finger, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.37,0:07:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It might get bitten by\None of my pets. Gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.57,0:07:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.43,0:07:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That's fine with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.75,0:07:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But we'll duel for two\NLocator cards. Two of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.39,0:08:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you lose both Locator cards, you'll\Nhave no way of getting to the finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.49,0:08:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's way too risky, Joey. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.43,0:08:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You even have to. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.03,0:08:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.55,0:08:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi squashed this creepy little bug.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.37,0:08:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,first time they squared\Noff at Dua's kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.53,0:08:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I guess it's my turn to do the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.73,0:08:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,How many locator cards do you have? Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.87,0:08:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Then once I step on you and take\Nthem both, plus your rarest card,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.31,0:08:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be personally responsible for kicking\Nyour ugly mug out of the tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.85,0:08:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.76,0:08:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like Yuge did last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.43,0:08:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.43,0:08:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.95,0:08:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.59,0:08:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I'll play my Swordsman\Nof Landstar in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.07,0:08:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll leave this little\Nnumber face down for later.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.03,0:08:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Take your best shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.85,0:08:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Swordsman looks like\Nhe popped out of a toy box.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.01,0:08:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,This toy's gonna slice and dice your hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.37,0:08:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.97,0:08:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I've played a much more powerful\Nflying commentary number one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.91,0:09:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, my flying friend, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.39,0:09:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Crash this mini-monster!\NUh-uh. Watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.07,0:09:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my shield and sword magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.93,0:09:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It swaps the attack and defense\Npoints of both our monsters,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.43,0:09:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,making my sword ring's attack\Nstrength a cut above your butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.75,0:09:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, nice try!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.45,0:09:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,But when flying Kamakiri number\None is sent to the graveyard,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.73,0:09:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,it automatically summons an even more\Npowerful warrior to take its place,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.19,0:09:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,the dreaded flying Kamakiri number two!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.97,0:09:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity, your brother's\Nname is Joey Wheeler, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.93,0:09:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.57,0:09:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, it says he's dueling with\Na regional champion right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.21,0:09:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't sound so worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.21,0:09:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,My brother came in second place\Nin the Duelist Kingdom tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.51,0:09:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.49,0:09:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I know Joey will beat this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.83,0:10:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You're no match for my winged\Nwarrior, so give it up, Wheeler!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.23,0:10:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome, it's Jinzo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.83,0:10:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,the card I won from Esperoba Now I just\Nneed to get it on the field Hurry up,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.29,0:10:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Wheeler! My flying\NKamakiri is getting hungry
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.57,0:10:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's feeding time Just\Nignore him Come on, Joey
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.21,0:10:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,No sweat. I'll just sacrifice my\NSwordsman so I can put Jinzo on the map
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.87,0:10:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinzo, smash his Kamakiri\Nlike a bug on a windshield
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.89,0:10:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.80,0:10:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That wasn't supposed to happen. Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.35,0:10:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat dirt, you little grub.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.91,0:10:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Squash that mealworm, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.65,0:10:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's one more.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.91,0:10:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,In defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.71,0:10:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Just try to attack this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.03,0:10:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You just set him up and I'll\Nknock him down. Jinzo, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.63,0:10:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.97,0:10:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, that's my flying leech, Kisatai.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.85,0:10:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It attaches itself to the\Nfirst monster that attacks it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.57,0:11:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it increases my life points\Nby 1,200 every time it's your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.47,0:11:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,So as long as my leech continues to\Npeen, my life points continue to grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.67,0:11:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.95,0:11:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.91,0:11:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And this is just the beginning\Nof what I have planned for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.67,0:11:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got a lot to learn\Nabout the insect world.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.21,0:11:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'm just the duelist\Nto teach you, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.11,0:11:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll play another\Nmonster in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.35,0:11:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.15,0:11:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll take more life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.19,0:11:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to my leech friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.05,0:11:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinzo may have a leech on him,\Nbut he can still cyber attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.93,0:11:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You're too kind. Hey, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.27,0:11:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,More life points. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.75,0:11:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You attacked my skull mark ladybug,\Nwhich gives me an extra 500 life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.07,0:11:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell you you had a lot to learn?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.87,0:11:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Insect cards can be very, very tricky.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.65,0:12:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid Joey is going to\Nhave to be ready for anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.77,0:12:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.68,0:12:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll play yet another\Nmonster in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.79,0:12:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And since it's your turn again,\Nmore life points, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.77,0:12:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,With my leash feeding on your monster,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.89,0:12:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,my life points will continue to\Ngrow, making me indestructible!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.01,0:12:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Say goodbye to the Battle\NCity Tournament, Wheeler!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.41,0:12:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Now how's Joey doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.21,0:12:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it looks like he's\Nin kind of a tight spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.23,0:12:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get me wrong, he's\Nplaying really well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.67,0:12:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But this Underwood guy\Nkeeps turning things around.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.03,0:12:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I know my brother can handle\Nwhatever his opponent tries to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.61,0:12:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.87,0:12:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,My brother Joey won't\Nlet anything stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.51,0:12:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,He's been in tough situations before,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.61,0:12:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,and he always comes\Nthrough and makes me proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.57,0:12:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.03,0:12:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Because if he loses his only two locator\Ncards, he's out of the tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.83,0:12:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one thing that my\Nbrother needs to do right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.13,0:12:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,He needs to believe in himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.71,0:12:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Here goes nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.01,0:12:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, this'll help.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.85,0:13:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to burn off your leech.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.91,0:13:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Bug Boy, meet Panther Warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.89,0:13:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It needs a sacrifice in order to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.59,0:13:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,So, I'll sacrifice my Jinzo\Nand get rid of your leech.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.23,0:13:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Panther Warrior, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.61,0:13:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.15,0:13:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey got rid of that blood-sucking leech.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.41,0:13:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That stops Weevil's life\Npoints from increasing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.79,0:13:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.75,0:13:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,OK, Wheeler, enough playing around.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.57,0:13:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Up until this point, I've\Nbeen going easy on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.93,0:13:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're starting to bug me,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.91,0:13:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,so the time has come to unleash\Nthe fury of my ultimate destroyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.85,0:13:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon the Larbemoth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.75,0:13:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the bug that Weevil\Nused against Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.71,0:13:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I see your memory's better\Nthan you're dueling, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.93,0:13:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You probably know that you're about to get
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.95,0:14:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,demolished once I wrap\Nmy terrifying larvae
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.61,0:14:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,in the all-powerful cocoon of evolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.53,0:14:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, this isn't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.97,0:14:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Over the next five turns,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.85,0:14:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,the cocoon of evolution will\Ntransform my mere larva loss
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.01,0:14:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,into a huge beast known as the\NPerfectly Ultimate Great Moth!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.55,0:14:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh, this is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.45,0:14:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Your brother might be in serious trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.05,0:14:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Weevil just combined some of the most\Npowerful cards in all of Duel Monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.59,0:14:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure that Joey can handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.11,0:14:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if he's really as good as you say\Nhe is, now's the time for him to prove it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.85,0:14:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Five more turns, Wheeler,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.77,0:14:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,and my Ultimate Great Moth will\Nemerge and turn you into Bug-Jow!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.19,0:14:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I gotta pop that pupa.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.49,0:14:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think so, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.31,0:14:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,My next card will crush any\Nchance of that happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.89,0:14:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, there's already a parasite\Nliving inside your deck. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.51,0:14:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Parasite!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.42,0:15:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,An insect that lives off of other animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.31,0:15:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,So I play Reckless Parasite, which\Nbrings the parasite in your deck to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.09,0:15:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta be out of your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.23,0:15:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,My deck doesn't have any insect card.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.85,0:15:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You were saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.23,0:15:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like you had a Parasite Parasite\Ncard in your deck and I've activated it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.27,0:15:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Now every monster you\Nplay will be infected.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.69,0:15:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That's really gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.15,0:15:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That little germ, it looks like\NWeevil pulled a fast one on you, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.17,0:15:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, but how'd he get that\Nparasite caught in my deck?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.75,0:15:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That kid must have been\Nworking for Weevil.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.99,0:15:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet he slipped it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.41,0:15:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,A great duelist prepares for an\Nencounter long before it takes place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.55,0:15:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's against the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.33,0:15:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You creepy little cheater. Cheater?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.49,0:15:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not my fault that Joey\Ndidn't think to examine
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.03,0:15:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,his deck before challenging\Nme to a duel. Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.67,0:15:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,watch it And while your\Nmonster's being infected,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.75,0:15:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,My great moth will be\Nevolving. So I'll play
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.81,0:16:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,One card face down and\Nend my turn. It's true,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.83,0:16:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,my panther warrior may be\Ninfected But he can still
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.55,0:16:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,attack you as long as I\Nsacrifice another monster,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.47,0:16:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Bugbret.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.11,0:16:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, every monster you play\Nbecomes infected by a parasite So?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.49,0:16:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,So you can't sacrifice a\Nparasite-infected monster,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.13,0:16:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,which means your pathetic\Npanther warrior can't attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.85,0:16:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I got another plan,\Nso I'll play Tiny Guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.51,0:16:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Now another one of your monsters is infected,\Nand my great boss is still evolving.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.47,0:16:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't seem to realize that your cocoon\Nof evolution has zero attack points.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.97,0:16:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack points mean nothing, you fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.47,0:16:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It's defending me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.59,0:16:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a closer look, flea-brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.67,0:16:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.07,0:16:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot to switch my cocoon\Ninto defense mode! That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.11,0:16:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,And with zero attack\Npoints, just sit and duck.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.75,0:16:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Tiny gaudy and attach!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.61,0:16:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! I'm done!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.89,0:16:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.03,0:17:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,This magic card will save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.37,0:17:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate Insect Barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.95,0:17:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It protects me by repelling\Nall insect attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.27,0:17:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And since every monster infected\Nby a parasite becomes an insect
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.73,0:17:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,My barrier will protect me and my\Ncocoon from all of your monsters
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.23,0:17:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't attack Come on,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.67,0:17:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey You gotta kick Weevil's cheating\Nbot to stay in the tournament Joey,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.33,0:17:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,you've got to stay calm and\Nbelieve in your deck There may
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.77,0:17:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Be a way to use Weevil's own\Ntrick against him. It is hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.13,0:17:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Once my great moth awakens and then\Nemerges from its cocoon in just four turns,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.61,0:17:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,it will completely annihilate you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.63,0:17:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on with my brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.85,0:17:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, his cards are still\Ninfested with that parasite.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.31,0:17:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What about that gross moth thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.79,0:17:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It says here that Joey still has four\Nmoves before it hatches. That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.35,0:17:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But when that happens...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.29,0:17:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.55,0:18:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gonna take a miracle\Nto keep him from losing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.37,0:18:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Joey Wheeler.\NThanks to my barrier, none
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.07,0:18:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,of your monsters can\Nattack me and while i wait
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.37,0:18:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,for my great moth to\Nevolve i'll start weakening
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.33,0:18:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,your life points i know\Ni can take this guy
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.67,0:18:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,first i gotta build up\Nmy defense to protect
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.85,0:18:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,my life points then\Nlike yuki's grandpa said
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.45,0:18:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,maybe i can use that\Nparasite card to help me
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.75,0:18:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,now i summon lego attack\Nhis life points directly
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.51,0:18:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! How'd you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.03,0:18:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I still have monsters on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.55,0:18:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Lekul is able to bypass your monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.19,0:18:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Your life points are in serious\Ntrouble, and you still can't attack me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.41,0:18:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Care to throw in the towel, Wheeler?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.87,0:18:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.45,0:18:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I switched both of my\Nmonsters into defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.63,0:18:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,How sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.54,0:18:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what happens in\Njust three more turns.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.37,0:18:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,My great moth is born.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.37,0:19:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But meanwhile, Leola attacks\Nhis life points directly!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.25,0:19:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give up, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.63,0:19:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You turn, and you still can't attack me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.05,0:19:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta pass again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.35,0:19:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Just one turn to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.01,0:19:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.79,0:19:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,My ultimate great moth\Nis like nothing you've
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.73,0:19:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,ever faced before or will ever face again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.93,0:19:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough with the moth,\NUnderwood. We get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.01,0:19:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay cool, Tristan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.43,0:19:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,This is just like when Yugi dueled that\Nrare hunter and I was freaking out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.29,0:19:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But he showed me that even\Nwhen the odds are against you,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.69,0:19:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,a true duelist keeps his\Ncool and trusts his deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.59,0:19:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel isn't over yet, Weevil.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.65,0:19:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I still got some preparing to\Ndo before your moth hatches.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.37,0:19:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I play Alligator's Sword in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.05,0:19:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And I play another card\Nface down to end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.37,0:20:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Now your gator is parasite food, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.59,0:20:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.39,0:20:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm all set to face\Nthis big moth of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.93,0:20:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,So why don't you bring it on now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.97,0:20:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We're about to see\Nexactly how ready you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.03,0:20:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Time's up, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.83,0:20:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Ultimate great moth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.85,0:20:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Erupt from your cocoon and\Nreveal your supreme power.
